Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "The princess must have headed to the
Enemy Base. Guess I better rescue her.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Hey, I can help! But...it looks like there's
a Gatekeeper at the Enemy Base!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Both the throne room and the Gatekeeper
are strengthened by magic. Wonderful.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Best to divide the west and east sides
and advance. I'll take the east!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Wow, these enemies aren't pushovers...
Looks like they're coming from the palace.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "I don't care how strong our opponents
are. I will put an end to their madness!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Zelda is keeping the Twilight magic from
devouring everything, but she won't last!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Dang it... They're trying to fortify the keep
and maintain the Twilight magic's power...",
  "1.0.8.0" => "We can't get into the Enemy Base with all
this Twilight magic! We've got to act!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "The Gatekeeper is a shadow of Zant? If we
weaken its magic, we can defeat it!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "So we can weaken the Twilight magic by 
taking keeps? Let's go!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "Who's doing all this? Someone's
capitalizing on Zelda's strained abilities...",
  "1.0.12.0" => "This enemy seems tough, but if we take
more keeps, I bet he'll be a pushover.",
  "1.0.13.0" => "With those monsters, we don't need to
take all the keeps--three would do it.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Uh-oh! It looks like our base is in trouble!
I'd better go do something to defend it!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Let's keep this up and take more of those
keeps! We can't keep Zelda waiting!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Good, that's one less roadblock.",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Oh come on... And we were just starting
to gather some momentum here...",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Phew! Now all we have to do is take
the throne room! Er, I think...",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Oh no! It's even more fortified! How are
we going to get to the princess now?",
  "1.0.20.0" => "I managed to stop my half of the enemies!
C'mon! Let's take that keep!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "They managed to fortify the throne room...
Ugh, now it'll take us forever to get to Zelda.",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Zelda, are you all right? Conserve your
strength! If you fall, then it's all over for us!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "I need to stop their commander. In the
meantime, weaken the other enemies.",
  "1.0.24.0" => "I will put an end to this evil Twilight
magic, even if it means the end of me!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "No! Somebody! STOP HER!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Excellent! We weakened enemy forces by
taking the keep!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "We did it! That means no more monsters
spewing out of those keeps!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "...What?! Different monsters?!
Well THAT'S not fair.",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Wonderful, look who they decided to
call out. Careful! He's no slouch!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Avoid that slob, and focus your efforts
on the keeps with Twilight magic!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "We need more troops! I'm going
to call for reinforcements!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "We're joining in! Let's stop
that beast together!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Great! That means we can concentrate
on taking the keeps!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Thanks for covering us! Our mission's
complete, so we're taking off!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "They couldn't call for reinforcements...
That means the base is our responsibility!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "I'll open those gates with my own two
hands if I have to. Hold on, Zelda!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Zelda! You're still alive! Thank goodness!
Here, take some of my magic reserves.",
  "1.0.38.0" => "You have my gratitude!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Zelda...!
How could they...",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Hey, my compass is glowing again!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Don't get cocky. You helped, but don't forget
that you're talking to a princess of Twilight here.",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Hey, I DID defeat the strongest-looking
monster, didn't I?",
  "1.0.43.0" => "But...it looks like the Twilight magic is
still at work. What should we do?",
  "1.0.44.0" => "It'll be fine. This is my domain, so let
me handle it from here.",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Our base! How are we supposed to rescue
Zelda if we can't even defend our own base?",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Forgive me... I...wasn't strong enough...",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Hey! The Enemy Base still won't open!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "I won't let you get away with this!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "That's one side taken care of!
Now, let's take that keep!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "We must do something!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "I will not allow the evil Twilight magic
to consume this world!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "There's Twilight magic coming from the
northern keep. Let's start there!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "What got them all fired up? Great, we can't
handle this. Not with Zelda so weak...",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Hey, look alive! I think our enemies
are up to something.",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Good, the magic weakened! Now stay
outta my way!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "The Gatekeeper is down! That just leaves
the keep, and the Enemy Base should open!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "I'll keep the princess safe!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "If we capture the keep, it should weaken
the Enemy Base's gate and Gatekeeper!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Midna... I've taken all that you had to give...
though I did not want it. Thanks for this... And you...",
  "1.0.60.0" => "You stopped the summoning and focused
the remaining magic.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "How could they call forth more enemies?
We can't keep this up!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "All right! Leave the west to me!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "If the Gatekeeper and gates lose power,
I should be able to open the gates!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Midna... You look...different... And who
is that other girl?",
  "1.0.65.0" => "I'm Linkle! I'm going to rescue you!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Right. Less talking, more rescuing.",
  "1.0.67.0" => "As the hero, it's only natural that I do
the rescuing.",
  "1.0.68.0" => "After all, a fake is a fake...and no matter how much
you dress things up, the real thing always wins!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "We should go to the east first and capture
the enemy outpost. Ready? Let's go!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Oh, come on! Hurry and capture the Eastern
Keep! You didn't get distracted, did you?",
  "13.0.4.0" => "The bridge is down, but don't worry about it!
You just focus on getting that keep!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "A chest? Heh, don't mind if I do...",
  "13.0.6.0" => "We're being attacked from the air! How are
we supposed to combat that...?",
  "13.0.7.0" => "We'll have to use magic if we want to
damage the dragon in midflight!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "I'll create a Magic Circle in the keep
underneath the dragon! Buy some time!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Monsters are in my way! Can someone do
me a favor and get rid of them?",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Will you dainty little flowers be OK without
me holding your hands on the front lines?",
  "13.0.11.0" => "He struck when I was gone! Darn! I need
to finish that Magic Circle immediately...",
  "13.0.12.0" => "The Magic Circle is finished! Use it to really
give that dragon something to roar about!",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Our base can't take much more!
Hurry--someone use the Magic Circle!",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Wonderful! I hope that's the last we'll
hear from our friend the dragon...",
  "13.0.15.0" => "Oh no, they're trying to take Agitha!
Keep the monsters away from her!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "Agitha's been taken! Dang... That'll really
please the enemies in the east...",
  "13.0.17.0" => "The Magic Circles are key! Capture the
keep that's directly below the dragon!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "Same plan as last time? Too easy!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "It wants to attack the base again...
We have to hit it hard and hit it fast!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "The Magic Circle is ready! Make this one
really count!",
  "13.0.21.0" => "That's about all I can do... Quick, defeat
that dragon with the Magic Circle!",
  "13.0.22.0" => "Look! The magic attack worked! We should
be able to hit the dragon with normal attacks!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Third time, huh? Haaaa... How many times
will we have to go through this?",
  "13.0.24.0" => "The Magic Circle doesn't seem to have the
effect we want, but what else can we do...?",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Let's just follow the butterfly to the building
in the southeast! Trust it knows something!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "A Magic Circle in the Fairy Fountain...
That should help us take down Argorok!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "Our base is the last building standing!
DO NOT LET IT FALL!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "See? We can pull through this!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "We just need to defeat Argorok and Zant...
Hey, that won't be too hard, right?",
  "13.0.30.0" => "You're a product of your own greed... You and
Cia both.",
  "13.0.31.0" => "Yes! Nice work, everyone!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "We cleared out anyone in our way!
Now let's seal the Gate of Souls!",
  "13.0.33.0" => "We've got enemies swarming the base!
Someone defend it!",
  "13.0.34.0" => "Our base is on the brink of falling!
It needs someone to defend it immediately!",
  "13.0.35.0" => "I've let everyone down... I'm so sorry...",
  "13.0.36.0" => "Our base fell...? Then this fight is over...",
}